OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fevening sunshine to end Saturday, with
OL,7,Fskies remaining clear at first
OL,8,Ftonight, and turning chilly. A few
OL,9,Fmist and fog patches possible. Cloud
OL,10,Fincreasing a little towards the end of
OL,11,Fthe night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FA dry but largely cloudy start
OL,14,Fon Sunday. Heavy and persistent rain
OL,15,Fwill arrive later in the afternoon,
OL,16,Fwith strengthening winds. Mild but
OL,17,Ffeeling cooler in the rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
